        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thom Yorke, Bruce Guthro\n- Bands: Radiohead, Runrig\n- Songs: \"All I Need\"\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, composer, solo artist\n\nFacts:\n- Thom Yorke was born on 7 October 1968.\n- Bruce Guthro was born as Bruce Guthrie on August 31, 1961, and he is a Canadian singer-songwriter from Cape Breton Island, Nova Scotia.\n- Thom Yorke is an English musician and composer best known as the singer and principal songwriter of the alternative rock band Radiohead.\n- In 1998, Bruce Guthro joined the Scottish folk rock band Runrig while continuing his solo career.\n- Bruce Guthro has also recorded as a solo artist.\n- \"All I Need\" is a Radiohead song described as one of the band's most direct love songs.\n- In \"All I Need,\" Thom Yorke sings about obsession and unrequited love on a downbeat track.",
